-- view: floodsense_seed.hazard_timeline
-- columns: point_id string, ts_utc timestamp, rain_mm double, discharge_m3s double, warning_level string
-- min_rows: 960
-- Replaces 013. Same columns. Valencia rows are 013's, unchanged (28-30 Oct 2024, 576 rows).
-- Adds 384 Ahr rows for the EMSR517 replay: AHR01-AHR04, hourly UTC 2021-07-13 to 2021-07-16.
-- rain_mm: Open-Meteo Historical Weather API (ERA5 reanalysis); discharge_m3s: that day's GloFAS
-- value from 045, repeated per hour as in 007. Modelled, not observed. warning_level is NULL.
-- Data: Open-Meteo, CC BY 4.0. Generated by ingestion/prep/ahr_hazard.py. Do not hand-edit.
